---
// src/components/partners/AgencyEngagementModels.astro
---
<section class="py-20 bg-slate-50 border-b border-slate-200">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-brand-primary mb-3">Flexible Collaboration</h2>
      <h3 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-brand-navy tracking-tight mb-4">
        Agency Engagement Models Built for High Margins
      </h3>
      <p class="text-base text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
        Whether you need an on-demand delivery partner for sudden client surges or a dedicated monthly sprint squad, our wholesale agency pricing leaves you with healthy 45%–65% gross margins.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      <!-- Model 1 -->
      <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 shadow-xs flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="inline-flex items-center px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold bg-slate-100 text-slate-700 mb-4">
            Fixed Scope
          </div>
          <h4 class="text-xl font-bold text-brand-navy mb-3">Project-by-Project Subcontracting</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Ideal for agencies closing discrete client projects: a single Kajabi site build, an LMS migration, or a 5-module interactive course build.
          </p>
          <ul class="space-y-3 text-xs text-slate-600 mb-8">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-brand-accent font-bold">&check;</span>
              <span>Fixed, predictable wholesale pricing per deliverable</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-brand-accent font-bold">&check;</span>
              <span>Guaranteed milestone-based delivery dates</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-brand-accent font-bold">&check;</span>
              <span>Zero ongoing commitment or minimum monthly spend</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-brand-accent font-bold">&check;</span>
              <span>Complete handover with documentation and video walkthroughs</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <a href="#partner-intake" class="w-full text-center py-2.5 px-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-200 text-brand-navy font-bold text-xs transition-colors">
          Scope a Client Project &rarr;
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Model 2 (Featured) -->
      <div class="bg-gradient-to-b from-brand-navy to-slate-900 text-white p-8 rounded-3xl border border-brand-primary/40 shadow-xl flex flex-col justify-between relative overflow-hidden">
        <div class="absolute -right-12 -top-12 w-40 h-40 bg-brand-accent/20 rounded-full blur-2xl pointer-events-none"></div>
        <div>
          <div class="inline-flex items-center px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold bg-brand-accent text-white mb-4">
            Most Popular
          </div>
          <h4 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Dedicated Sprint Retainer</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Your agency’s dedicated fractional e-learning engineering team. Predictable capacity every single month to deliver client retainers effortlessly.
          </p>
          <ul class="space-y-3 text-xs text-slate-300 mb-8">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-brand-secondary font-bold">&check;</span>
              <span>Reserved monthly engineering & instructional hours</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-brand-secondary font-bold">&check;</span>
              <span>Direct Slack / Teams channel with our senior leads</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-brand-secondary font-bold">&check;</span>
              <span>Priority turnaround & weekly backlog sprint planning</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-brand-secondary font-bold">&check;</span>
              <span>Seamless white-label integration into your PM tool</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <a href="#partner-intake" class="w-full text-center py-2.5 px-4 rounded-xl bg-brand-accent hover:bg-brand-accent/90 text-white font-bold text-xs transition-all shadow-md shadow-brand-accent/30 hover:scale-[1.02]">
          Reserve Dedicated Capacity &rarr;
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Model 3 -->
      <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 shadow-xs flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="inline-flex items-center px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold bg-slate-100 text-slate-700 mb-4">
            On-Demand
          </div>
          <h4 class="text-xl font-bold text-brand-navy mb-3">Surge & Overflow Support</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">
            When your in-house team is at 100% capacity and you cannot afford to turn down high-value client deals, we step in as your emergency delivery buffer.
          </p>
          <ul class="space-y-3 text-xs text-slate-600 mb-8">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-brand-accent font-bold">&check;</span>
              <span>Fast onboarding with pre-signed master services agreement (MSA)</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-brand-accent font-bold">&check;</span>
              <span>Emergency 48-hour sprint kickoffs for tight client deadlines</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-brand-accent font-bold">&check;</span>
              <span>Flexible scaling: ramp up or down based on your pipeline</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-brand-accent font-bold">&check;</span>
              <span>High-touch senior QA so client reputation stays pristine</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <a href="#partner-intake" class="w-full text-center py-2.5 px-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-200 text-brand-navy font-bold text-xs transition-colors">
          Discuss Overflow Setup &rarr;
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
